WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.210
(Narrate by Hiroshi Tokoro)
That's a terrible ritual.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.170
During this season,

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.620
human will lose their mind in snatching

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:12.670
and collecting offerings.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.290
They fight to contribute.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:18.330
Some will benefit from it,
while others will not.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.420
Both winners and losers take turns.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.620
What a rejoiceful and incredibly festive.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.330
It'll be held on time
whenever the season arrives.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.260
(Aladdin Bento)
Oh my, it's so horrible.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.710
This mysterious festive
has bled my best friend dry.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.390
He has lost one hundred thousand yen.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.710
Hold on.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.250
Do you mean

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.770
Valentine's Day?

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.460
Yes, that's right.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:49.530
Is he referring to events of some games?

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:58.080
To most adults,
Valentine's Day doesn't a thing to them.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:02.040
I guess this festive could be an advantage.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.540
Monster of Valentine's Day.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.420
(Leader of Secret Society Agastia)
What?

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:06.800
(Akashic)
Sounds interesting.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.540
Yes, it'll definitely bring a whirlwind
to battling.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:12.460
Please consider this.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.710
Hold on, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.380
(Megistus, the Absolute-zero Staff Officer)
Monsters of Agastia

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.170
were all based on customs and legends.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:24.940
Are there any customs
that are related to Valentine's Day?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.040
No. There aren't.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:31.420
But there're also events for Valentine's Day
in fantasy games

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.910
as well as those unrelated businesses.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.450
I think I can understand

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:37.460
I think I can understand
that the business opportunity on Valentine's Day
is the most important one.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:41.250
that the business opportunity on Valentine's Day
is the most important one.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.120
Business opportunity?

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.380
Are monsters merchants?

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:03.390
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.230
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:10.330
♫Live within the current power♫

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:13.460
♫Special force♫

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:19.620
(Miss Kuroitsu from the Monster Development Department)
♫Special force♫

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.040
♫Everyone possesses this power (Power)♫

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.790
♫Being locked up without realising it♫

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.170
♫You are the courageous flower (Flower)♫

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.920
♫Fighting against with nonsense today♫

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.040
♫Warfare against the sleepiness in the morning♫

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.800
♫Psychological warfare begins at forenoon,
bringing the project to the meeting♫

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.500
♫Don't lose. You'll be fine♫

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.430
♫It's gonna be ok!!♫

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.060
♫The hardworking one deserves respect♫

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.500
♫You'll be rewarded one day♫

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.480
♫Wake up and believe in this power.
Do it again♫

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.580
♫Everyone is special.
Only one, Let's go!!♫

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.030
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.490
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:05.290
♫Persistence empowers you.
The important special force♫

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.750
♫Keep striving to march forward today
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.550
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:14.170
♫Keep it up. Stronger♫

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:17.960
♫With your beautiful special force♫

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:19.960
(Episode 6: A Pure Soul Ravaged
By an Invisible Power

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:20.960
(Bears Fruit Under Extreme Wrath and Impatience)

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:21.970
(And Show Itself as an Evil Demon.)

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.170
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
My report is approved.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.540
(Touka Kuroitsu, Assistant)
Really?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.580
(Wolf Bete, Novice Assistant)
That's great, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.730
Let's get started then.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.880
(Professor Hajime Sadamaki)
The project of monster of Valentine's Day.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.500
Sure.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.960
Miss Kuroitsu

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:38.500
has finally stepped on the path of no return.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.790
The time-limited monster.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.500
Very soon, she'll surely realise

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.420
how terrible it is.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:50.580
Like this. I'll make the surface of the monster
as though the chocolate is being poured over.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.210
However, I have no idea how to control budget
and conserve the monster.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:59.330
How about the special polymer
of the dripping chocolate?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.020
It's a chocolate monster,
how ridiculous if it's not made from chocolate.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.880
How about adding a small amount of chocolate
to the monster's substance?

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.290
Isn't it lying?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.270
(Contain Less Than One Percent of Chocolate
Manufactured by Agastia)

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.830
It's like a fraudulent food business...

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.920
Anyway, the monster is not for eating.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.960
I see no necessity to use chocolate.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.040
No way.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.210
Don't ignore the chocolate.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.290
The chocolate on Valentine's Day
is the crystallisation of love.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.170
Madam Akashic.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:38.380
Kuroitsu, you have never made chocolate before,
right?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.300
If that's the case, how would you produce
a perfect chocolate monster?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.880
She hits the nail on the head.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.040
But, I'm not a student anymore.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.710
Am I too dedicated to producing
handmade chocolate at this age though?

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.710
It'll leave others a bad impression instead.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.250
That's not true, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.960
Besides, I see no problem to receive chocolate.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.790
Maybe I'll receive one too.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.920
Your girlish hearts are dying out.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:08.580
I'll give you special training
in making chocolate.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.080
Why should I wear an apron?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.420
This work obviously belongs to Wolf though.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.880
Why me?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.330
No...

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.330
But, this suits Miss Kuroitsu well.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.520
It's cute.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.170
Seriously?

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.650
I feel shy since you've said it.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.270
Are you ready?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.500
First, think of someone you like.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.790
It can be any kind of hot guy.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.880
It'll be difficult if he's too hot though.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.120
I have no interest in guys.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.960
Just think about it.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.880
Chop the chocolate into pieces.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.830
Is it okay to use commercial products?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.880
If we don't use ingredients like cocoa butter,

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:05.460
cocoa liquor, lecithin, trehalose stated here,

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.580
we can't claim it as handmade chocolate, can we?

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.080
Are you looking down at me?

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.580
Where can you get trehalose?

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.750
Chop the chocolate and
simmer it over a water bath.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.820
Then pour into a container to solidify
and it's done.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.040
Isn't it the same if we just pour it into
the container to solidify?

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.880
If so, can't we use the ready-made chocolate?

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:33.420
Enough, Miss Minus One.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.330
Huh?

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.460
If you become Miss Minus Three,

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:40.040
I'll banish you to a room that can completely
burn a girl's heart.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.340
Sorry, I'm too outspoken.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.750
Are you alright, Miss Kuroitsu?

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.330
Leave aside Madam Akashic's training,

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:56.000
I can't get the balance between the budget and
the quality of the main ingredient, chocolate.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:00.230
If we can't decide on the supplier,
we'll be late for the submission.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:04.210
Miss Kuroitsu, I have found an ideal supplier.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.460
Really?

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:12.330
I've never heard about Marukari Corporate.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.870
It's qualified if the quality of the ingredients
is as stated.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.580
They import the product from overseas
with special methods.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.580
If our requirement isn't much,
they can provide to us within our budget.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.380
Great job, Wolf.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.420
I'll register for the new supplier right now.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.790
Probably we can catch up with the submission.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.670
(Melty, the Chocolate Monster)

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:53.290
I'll suffocate Blader with
the chocolate of love.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.790
Great! Melty has finally showed up.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.290
I should thank Madam Akashic.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.960
If it wasn't your lovely training,

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:06.830
we can never produce such perfect Melty.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.580
Hello, Monster Development Department speaking.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.170
What?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.080
What has happened, Wolf?

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.790
Miss Kuroitsu.

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.500
(Urgent Apology Press Conference)
It's the press conference for the incident

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.830
(Metal Flakes Found in Marukari's Chocolate)
of substances found in Marukari's chocolate.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:30.120
Regarding the metal flakes found
in the chocolate,

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:35.040
we'd like to express our deepest apologies
to our customers and related businesses.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.830
(Please be careful about the screen flicker!)
We're truly sorry.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.250
Marukari Corporate...

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:42.330
Forget it. It's not for eating though.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.080
Also, we're using it on Blader.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.670
Our goal is to defeat that brat.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.790
I won't allow this to happen.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.290
Sir Megistus.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:54.670
A responsible evil secret society
will never recognise this.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.670
Destroy the chocolate monster, Melty.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:05.460
Hold on...Sir.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:09.360
It'll be fine. I still can fight
even if I'm mixed with other substances.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.380
We can't provide merchants
with food safety issues.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.170
It's related to the reputation
of the organisation.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.870
But, Sir.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.210
The basic design is still useable.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.420
If the ingredient is replaced,
we can still remake...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.580
Didn't you notice that, Miss Kuroitsu?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.880
Even if you start to remake,

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.630
we can't make it on 14th February.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:35.170
A chocolate monster that only shows up
after Valentine's Day

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.430
will look like a hasty work.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.080
Under such conditions,
not to mention it's meant to beat Blader up,

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.000
she'll definitely be defeated.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.540
Her combat force will instantly be halved
as long as the festive is over.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:49.040
That's the scary thing about
time-limited monsters.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.250
It's screwed up.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:03.290
Even the love of a young girl
can't win over rules.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.380
Not yet.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.250
If we have no more time no produce a monster,

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.790
our effort can't turn in vain anyway.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:16.620
Then, on 14th February, Valentine's Day.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.500
Here comes Kenshin Blader.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:25.540
Hateful Agastia, what monster
would you send out this time?

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:37.830
This is the crystallisation of our love,
blood, and tears.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.460
Namely Chocolate.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:44.000
The content is the handmade chocolate
from the special training.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.880
And the photo with Melty

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.250
and her remains.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.540
But, it's not edible.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:55.040
Melty will definitely finish you next year.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.670
What?

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.920
Great!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:13.940
It's the first time he received chocolate
on Valentine's Day.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.450
(Melty, the Chocolate Monster)

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:29.920
I'm President Dark Crow from Dark Owl Army.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.960
We're from Dead Talent Dispatch Company.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.220
Please look out for us.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.620
Thank you for coming.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.710
We're having trouble for lacking combatants.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.970
We've met the same case in other places too.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.670
It seems everyone is experiencing recession.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:48.350
Quite a lot of organisations couldn't recruit
formal combatants.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.750
We have many experienced employees.
Please leave it to us.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.960
They've been to all kinds of workplaces before.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.500
They're all familiar faces I've met.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.120
And they're truly experienced.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.540
Someone who's not able to communicate,

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.960
someone who only knows about gambling,

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.120
someone who claims to be a very bad guy before,

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.500
someone who claims to make money from stocks,

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.130
and an old man who looks dangerous.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:17.920
Hey, are you free after work? It's fine
if you're free tomorrow. Let's have a drink.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.880
Also, someone who flirts
whenever he spots any lady.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.330
Basically, it's the troubles I've met
in the work.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.960
Then, I'll count on you

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.080
for the battle with Toshimach.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.710
-Sure.
-Yes.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.120
I'm sure

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.420
we won't win.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.620
The employee on duty, read the pledge.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.420
Good morning.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.960
Not loud enough.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.420
Good morning.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:45.960
(Red Room, Monster)
Everyone, please look out for me.

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:47.910
I'm Monster Red Room.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.170
A few days ago, I went to a convenience store
to buy something.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:55.420
I've discovered that the radish in oden packets
has reduced from two pieces to one.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.830
But, the price still remains.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:01.430
I deeply feel that it's a recession now.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:02.580
Therefore, I realised that

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:08.750
Commander should be the one to rule the world.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.040
Commander, Sir Kaiser Lore.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:17.070
(Sir Kaiser Lore of Black Lore)
I'm very worried.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.380
Did you hear that, everyone?

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.500
(Monster Officer, Red-caped General)
Sir Kaiser Lore is very worried now.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:27.580
We should complete the plan to conquer the world
as soon as possible.

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:30.580
Let's shout the rules out.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.580
One, always wear on a smile at work.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.170
Two, our effort will never turn in vain.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.380
The hardworking one will surely succeed.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.040
Three, everyone should sacrifice
for the organisation.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.080
If the organisation grows and prospers,

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.540
-everyone will surely have a blissful future.
-The morning assembly of Black Lore

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:52.850
-Four, the dedicated one only values result.
-spend 50 minutes every day.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.920
What's wrong, Professor?

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.790
Are you having a stomach ache again
for drinking milk?

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.170
(Monster Institute of Black Lore)
Oh my, sorry.

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.080
(Koharu Koen, Research Director)
I suffer from lactose intolerance.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.870
You'll know it if you grow older.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:10.210
(Elbucky, the Space Cat)
If the secretion of monsters turns weak,

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.420
one will have no idea what's happening
inside the body.

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.830
It's so scary.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.380
As compared to this,

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:19.790
the results of both research and actual combat
weren't good.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.620
If this keeps on going, I'll be demoted.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.540
No, it's better if that was the case.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:27.540
If I have to go to Intensive Training Center...

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.170
Intensive Training Center?

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:32.420
(Intensive Training Center)
It's said that it is in the organisation,

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:35.670
however, it's a mysterious department
that the interphone can't reach.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:39.670
It's an isolated building with no access
from the company.

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:44.620
One has to watch the video of the vice commander
preaching the organisation's rules

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:50.290
and then write his thoughts down.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.830
You're so afraid of it.
Be confident in yourself.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.620
I'm sorry, Professor.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.920
(Bullhead, the Monster)
Bullhead.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:01.790
(Purple Mirror, the Monster)
It was because of us being useless.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.880
Purple Mirror.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.460
It's not your fault.
My design isn't detailed enough.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:12.680
We've made Professor face the embarrassment
with us in the morning assembly.

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:19.690
General asked us to read our mistakes
in battles and reflections before everyone.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:23.380
Though we're the monsters
specially attacking minds,

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.950
our hearts are hurt
even before we launch the attack.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:31.210
After all, Red-Caped General is

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:33.670
is very strict.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.920
It's not about him being strict,

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.710
he's a black-hearted superior instead.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:41.080
Hey, Bucky. I won't care about you
if something happens to you.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.290
It can be settled if you send me.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.720
I can crush those novice magic girls
with one hand.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:51.250
Even if you've won, it wouldn't be counted as
the achievement of the institute though.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:54.540
I should present a new research result.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.040
What a troublesome organisation.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.170
New result?

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.290
Inter-organisation performance test?

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.540
Why did she raise such a sudden request again?

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.580
Wonder what's in Koen's mind again?

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.290
But, it's good though.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.580
Wolf, Hydra.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:16.620
(The Triple-regenerated Monster)
Let's show them

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.290
(The Genuine Hydra)
our techniques.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.620
Please count on me.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:20.500
Sure.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.460
Wolf.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.750
Long time no see.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.540
Here she's again, the perverted cat.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.830
No matter what, there'll be a showdown
between us.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:36.080
Oh my, Wolf. You'll end up pitifully
if I launch my real strength.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:39.270
What do you mean?

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:41.670
We can do it, sisters.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.670
I think my foundation will fade.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.880
That's too troublesome.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.170
Let's go shopping for shawls
after settling them in one go.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.030
Matsu is asking us to strive though.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.170
If we defeat the monsters from Agastia,

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.420
General will surely admit your function.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.160
Most importantly,

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.000
losing to Sadamaki is a shame.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.620
I'll never allow this to happen.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.040
Professor,

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.170
you've exposed your inner desire.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:16.040
Match begins.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.170
Come on, look into my eyes.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.460
And immense in the fear of pain.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.620
No way.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.580
Stop it. Don't come near.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:37.000
Bullhead, the mind corrosion monster.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:40.460
He possesses a pair of eyes that would incite
your fear whenever you look into them.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:45.040
It's an ability to deceive you into seeing
illusions of what you fear most.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.290
I got you.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:50.050
You possess fear even if you're a monster.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:52.750
This is my winning strategy.

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.620
Scum, how dare you bully Matsu.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:01.790
She'd even be frightened by just looking at
the packaging of horror movies.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.210
Whenever we go to the movie rental shop,

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:07.710
we'd pick the shortcut to avoid her
from passing through the horror zone.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.580
This is unforgivable.

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.790
It's impossible to corrode the minds of
all heads simultaneously.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.700
You're really something, Sadamaki.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.670
You've even prepared for this.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:23.080
No, not really.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.960
Are these monsters possess the special ability
to attack one's mind?

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.710
But, it won't work on me.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.470
I think it will work though.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.840
I'm sure Wolf will be defeated immediately.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.620
It's hard to say though.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:41.710
I, Purple Mirror is completely different
from Bullhead.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.960
Even if one has a strong will to resist fear,

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.540
the person can't resist happiness.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:54.670
I'm going to lock you in a happy dream
and you'll never return to the real world.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.170
What?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.250
Here's your death wish.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.000
Good job, Sister Wolf.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.380
Wolf is indeed amazing.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.540
Miss Kuroitsu, I've made it.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.670
You always have my trust.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.920
Honestly, I have something to tell you.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:21.170
I have always been...

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:28.020
You can do anything to me.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.290
Alright, Sister Wolf?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.250
How could it be possible?

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:41.330
How come she could escape from the mind mirror?

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.880
Something's wrong.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:49.170
Miss Kuroitsu call me Wolf,
instead of Sister Wolf.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:52.710
I'll never allow this mistake.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.670
What does she mean?

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.080
Perhaps she insists on something.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.880
So, you've run away with your tails
between your legs?

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:08.830
Although it's just a performance test,

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.830
