00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:15.110
I'm so sorry, Red-Caped General.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.210
You've disgraced Black Lore.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.870
I'm going to punish you.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:25.670
Please spare us.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:41.140
Then, General suddenly tendered his resignation.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:44.890
He seemed afraid to keep staying
in the organisation.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:47.620
What exactly did he see?

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:54.210
It seems the middle management of Black Lore
is also not an easy job.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.670
The brilliant sun.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.540
Owl Warrior Toshimach.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.170
Owl Warrior Prism.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.540
Let's show them our power.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.540
Yes. Let's go with Mach speed.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.460
Let's fight brilliantly.

